# Documentation

- Project docs live under `Docs/`. **Do not read the entire tree at once.**
- At task start, read only 1–2 rows from the task table in `Docs/README.md`.
- Full agent rules: `Docs/agents.md` (root `AGENTS.md` is a stub).
